{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"0cb838e1eef3f18c6f6cc26db834dda832379320d671dfe18350c557620aa740","ja":"ロコズレッスン","zh":"ROCO问答课程","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"8703e2f8723ae8441512169de3e26ddea044df4931208b1cb6bcee98da34b237","ja":"……ということで、ピカソはキュビズムを\n生み出したグレートなアーティストなのです！","zh":"……所以说，毕加索是创造了立体主义的\n伟大艺术家！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7c650a4179da5e95b12945250322bd8a06deda09972b630f0ad21af28019d067","ja":"うーん……たくさん教えてもらいましたけど、\nキュビズムの絵はよくわからないままかもしれません。","zh":"嗯……虽然你教了我很多，\n但立体派的画可能还是不太明白。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1f2df211e20801bd3c0fb52dd358f1a25f161456f7a16e7253ea47cf3b8e28be","ja":"そういうものなのです。とってもディフィカルトだから\n当時もディスカッションがよく行われていました。","zh":"就是这样的。因为非常困难，\n当时也经常进行讨论。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"11ff240fece2c4c437d775cfa5ff25ff92bac7787cb6d43fcf1c57cd71b0d568","ja":"そうだったんですね……！　ピカソさんが何を\n表現したかったか、もっと知りたいです！","zh":"原来是这样啊……！毕加索先生想要表达什么，我好想了解更多！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"3d4c8bfe39e27056f11ccf199a9f87be2db139f22e3d32fcd12fbb2fbf96f63b","ja":"素晴らしい姿勢ですよセリカ！　ここはテストの\n範囲外かもしれませんが、レクチャーしますね♪","zh":"真是了不起的态度啊，芹香！　这里可能不在考试范围内，\n不过我来给你讲解一下哦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"70b1724a88d37b6e74d0da6b7953a008a4a56a03d36c0aa9bf504d69f2853d40","ja":"ねえねえ何してるのー。\nなんか、盛り上がってる声が聞こえたけど。","zh":"喂喂，你在做什么呀——\n我好像听到了很热闹的声音呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"d23970f856a26abfc77edf204b194220320e32c14a83f13945791d7cf2e23048","ja":"あら？　もしかして……お勉強中？","zh":"哎呀？　该不会……正在学习？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"beab3a6f3b8b144ae6f4ed0e57e5ced12b63bae0d4aa322ce74a1b3d8359ee1f","ja":"はい！　ロコさん……いいえ、\nロコ先生に美術を教えてもらってました！","zh":"是的！ROCO……不对，\n是ROCO老师教我美术的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"8609167449681acb589ece7dd615ce035bc52adaabc6b25bade2fa3414ffc973","ja":"ロコが、ティーチャー……！\nそ、それほどでも～。","zh":"ROCO才是老师……！\n哪、哪里的话～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"1ea303760e296b05b1678a4fd1d0c6f9391fc38c64b9dcdb77d1a73b192f9a37","ja":"いいないいな～！\n私もロコロコ先生の授業受けた～い！","zh":"好羡慕～！\n我也想上ROCOROCO老师的课～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"da3ce58234c55d98b3a7962b9e74f6f9ee62f582be095e4805c2011c77af61f4","ja":"私もお邪魔じゃなければ……。\nロコ先生、どうかしら？","zh":"如果我也不算打扰的话……。\nROCO先生，你觉得呢？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"f90e2d55cbe416827f9f26c5d4ae00e536424dc013b3885a46de42c398fc19cb","ja":"ふふん♪　もちろんオーケーです！　ロコが\nティーチャーとしてアートの奥深さを教えてあげます！","zh":"哼哼♪　当然没问题！　ROCO\n作为老师来教你艺术的深奥之处！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_958.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"4cdfab3671110aef0b7d4956aa77c92989cc798f78f7abc08c5f72b6098c15fc","ja":"えへへ、みなさんと一緒なら\nもっともっと楽しくお勉強できそうですね♪","zh":"嘿嘿，和大家在一起的话\n就能更开心地学习了呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T18:16:53+00:00"}
